    },
    "notes": [
      "Trackdub ships the standalone ORT EP ABI plugin, not the Windows ML catalog EP.",
      "DLL suffix _1_7 means TensorRT-RTX library lineage 1.7 (1.7.1) inside EP ABI 0.5.0 (Windows). Linux installs through LinML.Catalog 0.6.0, which pins the 0.5.0 wheel (TensorRT-RTX 1.7.1). EP ABI 0.5.0 lists ORT 1.25-1.30 as compatible; Trackdub runs it on ORT 1.31 (verified 2026-10-22).",
      "The Windows cu13 bundle has no cudart import (CUDA runtime statically linked); the Linux cu13 bundle ships libcudart.so.13.",
      "docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/tensorrt-rtx/latest/ currently tracks newer product docs (1.7+). Prefer Trackdub reference docs for pin-specific behavior; treat /latest/ as upstream context, not a pin guarantee.",
      "GitHub EP ABI release notes are the pin-accurate changelog."
    ]
  },
